  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>“Did you maybe think I’d rather crush his skull a lot and just burn him a tiny bit, rather than do both equally?”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Kineticist 7th, must possess a kinetic blast that deals half its damage as one type and half as another.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using a kinetic blast which normally deals half its damage as one damage type and half its damage as another, you can instead split its damage between those two types however you see fit, so long as it deals at least 1 damage of each type per damage die of the blast.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-feats#toc47\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
